{"about_the_game":"<strong>A true AAA experience at an indie price!</strong> Why pay extra for unfinished games, with broken code, and lack of optimization when you can get this experience right now at a significantly lower cost - meet GameDev Trash. The game of tomorrow that will show you where the gaming industry is really heading and what awaits you in the future!<br><br><strong>The gameplay:</strong> Game Dev Trash is highly unconventional. Each level undergoes a genre shift, ranging from first-person shooter <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436390/extras/Shooter.gif?t=1692405337\" /> to third-person open-world RPG <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436390/extras/ezgif.com-video-to-gif.gif?t=1692405337\" /> and even horror. <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436390/extras/LS_HorrorTeaserno.gif?t=1692405337\" /> Additionally, the game features two unique levels. At the end of each level, players will encounter a boss that represents a different game industry persona, from developer to game producer. All of this is wrapped in a slightly insane plot about the modern game developer and its secrets, narrated by an off-screen voice.<br><strong>If you enjoy silly jokes and unique gameplay, then this game is perfect for you!</strong><br><br><strong>!!CAUTION!!</strong><br>At the moment, there are 2 out of 5 planned levels in the game. The horror level is still under development, while the next two levels are only in the plans.<br><br>Favorite aggressive microtransactions and Day One DLCs - are just jokes. There is no aggressive microtransactions and Day One DLCs in game.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Bug Report","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2436390/2b36bc24983ddd5bdf789ac8f57a6bbdd7d7f84f.jpg"},{"name":"Junior","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2436390/6327bad74ebb93eff084a99c727c3a93fdaf57d5.jpg"},{"name":"It's just works","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2436390/0dc5a96369db55c4535d1a7a25ab937f20e68ae1.jpg"},{"name":"Haaazaaa","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2436390/87967c489a9164265ef38f611aa1096036b9a2e3.jpg"},{"name":"What a waste of time","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2436390/6d6a21639bbfc1a1bbb00c7994b0fd4ee89c367c.jpg"},{"name":"Archivarius","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2436390/cbd724bc0bf68b551e5feaf9b6a2f6d67dfae4a2.jpg"},{"name":"Failed State","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2436390/c0f719cf8a3ca15366a8799222a6f1151f5fc8c1.jpg"},{"name":"Fateful run","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2436390/8f383ae6882add9be7ca87c6cf2992086674c8f9.jpg"},{"name":"Are you winning son?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2436390/974b967eb559866bd825ce6a195f951b5c3bf525.jpg"}],"total":9},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2436390?t=1692405337","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436390/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1692405337","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436390/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1692405337","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436390/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1692405337","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<strong>A true AAA experience at an indie price!</strong> Why pay extra for unfinished games, with broken code, and lack of optimiza